  "historyNote": "#8444, eff 10-06-05; ss by #10412-B, eff 9-19-13; ss by #10808, eff 4-2-15; ss by #12619, eff 9-13-18; ss by #14591, eff 7-17-26, EXPIRES: 7-17-36",
